{"id":340,"bangumiId":340,"type":2,"name":"蟲師","name_cn":"虫师","date":"2005-10-22","year":"2005","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/40/00/340_J14Mj.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/40/00/340_J14Mj.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/40/00/340_J14Mj.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/40/00/340_J14Mj.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/40/00/340_J14Mj.jpg"},"summary":"这里的虫既不是动植物，也与微生物和菌类不同，是更接近生命原生态的东西。这些东西总称为“虫”。它们的形态和存在都很暧昧，当人与虫的世界重叠之时，发生了超越人类智慧的怪异现象，此时人类才开始知道它们的存在。 \r\n所谓生命，并非为威胁异己而存在。只是，各自以各自的形态存在着——作为连接这样的”虫“与人类的”虫师“--主人公银古，在旅途中不断与各种各样的人及与其关联的虫相遇。绘就了每话登场人物各不相同，读不尽的画卷。","rating":{"rank":21,"total":12017,"count":{"1":20,"2":9,"3":10,"4":19,"5":93,"6":273,"7":1027,"8":3069,"9":4454,"10":3043},"score":8.7},"collection":{"on_hold":2332,"dropped":425,"wish":9956,"collect":16653,"doing":2870},"tags":[{"name":"治愈","count":3851,"total_count":310660},{"name":"虫师","count":2855,"total_count":4243},{"name":"奇幻","count":1761,"total_count":497906},{"name":"神音乐","count":1445,"total_count":1680},{"name":"空灵","count":1353,"total_count":1440},{"name":"内涵系","count":1332,"total_count":1752},{"name":"TV","count":1231,"total_count":1456633},{"name":"2005","count":1094,"total_count":23999},{"name":"治愈系","count":909,"total_count":25449},{"name":"人生","count":887,"total_count":12161},{"name":"水墨","count":561,"total_count":1373},{"name":"漫画改","count":508,"total_count":898993},{"name":"ArtLand","count":481,"total_count":3362},{"name":"蟲師","count":445,"total_count":2619},{"name":"内涵","count":408,"total_count":6920},{"name":"银古","count":342,"total_count":363},{"name":"2005年10月","count":222,"total_count":2123},{"name":"银古叔","count":215,"total_count":220},{"name":"漫改","count":180,"total_count":372814},{"name":"日本","count":143,"total_count":320601},{"name":"长滨博史","count":127,"total_count":1216},{"name":"行走","count":109,"total_count":112},{"name":"神作","count":93,"total_count":48697},{"